  abilityNotes: 'IMPLEMENTED (EmpressAbility). Condition: 2+ Queens played this match.
    On play she greens the tiles she occupies; a friendly card later played on green
    gains +3 HP, applied at placement so it''s part of the unit''s StartingHp. Two
    readings decided rather than guessed: the +3 is per unit, not per green tile
    covered (a 4x4 unit would otherwise gain +48), and greening outlives her, since
    she changes the terrain and nothing says the effect ends with her.'
